(7824956, 1308785, 119696, '<td valign="top">
This one kept me awake at night. not really. but I tried and tried to get the lines straight then I would lose the bottom line, I tried the crescent straight then all other lines will be diagnol. so I went with the base line to be straight and settled.i wish they would have lined it up for us photographers. 😆</td>', 'This one kept me awake at night. not really. but I tried and tried to get the lines straight then I would lose the bottom line, I tried the crescent straight then all other lines will be diagnol. so I went with the base line to be straight and settled.i wish they would have lined it up for us photographers. 😆', '2026-07-07 09:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7824957, 1308734, 77196, '<td valign="top">
