(7826416, 1308531, 12200, '<td valign="top">
I love it when portraits manage to convey personality without it feeling "posed" or "forced." This is clearly a posed shot, of course--not a candid. But it doesn''t feel the least bit like a "contrived" composition. And the personality of the subject--the balance of intensity and gentleness--comes through clear as day.</td>', 'I love it when portraits manage to convey personality without it feeling "posed" or "forced." This is clearly a posed shot, of course--not a candid. But it doesn''t feel the least bit like a "contrived" composition. And the personality of the subject--the balance of intensity and gentleness--comes through clear as day.', '2026-07-13 13:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
